    <tags>convert converter file-converter compress resize batch filestar</tags>
    <summary>Do anything with any file</summary>
    <description>Filestar converts, compresses, resizes, renames and transforms files: thousands of formats (documents, images, audio, video, 3D, CAD, archives, embroidery and more) from one app or the command line (filestarcli). Many conversions run locally; some use Filestar&apos;s cloud.

Installs the desktop app and puts filestarcli on the PATH, without an installer window. Filestar updates itself; `choco upgrade filestar` works too.

More ways to install: https://filestar.com/help/installation/other-ways-to-install</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://filestar.com/</releaseNotes>
